/E (Shift refugee healthcare progressively from humanitarian dependency toward sustained inclusion within national and county health systems, supported through public financing rather than parallel NGO-led structures.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
500 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1065 0 R
/E (Incorporate mobility directly into climate and health planning by prioritising refugee-hosting counties within climate-health strategies and investing in resilient healthcare infrastructure, water systems, and supply chains in high-risk areas)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
