/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 268 0 R
/T (Migration Pulse Hub Migration Pulse Hub \(MPH\) is an independent, Africa-rooted organisation dedicated to advancing the rights, dignity and protection of refugees, migrants and internally displaced persons. Through research-based policy engagement, strategic legal support, advocacy and inclusive programming, MPH works to generate evidence, influence policy and strengthen rights-respecting responses to mobility and displacement. Guided by human rights, inclusion and context-driven analysis, MPH focuses on climate justice, health, education, gender and technology, with the aim of amplifying affected voices, supporting community resilience and promoting durable, people-centred solutions across the continent. Access some of the publications by Migration Pulse Hub at www.migrationpulsehub.org)
/E (Migration Pulse Hub Migration Pulse Hub \(MPH\) is an independent, Africa-rooted organisation dedicated to advancing the rights, dignity and protection of refugees, migrants and internally displaced persons. Through research-based policy engagement, strategic legal support, advocacy and inclusive programming, MPH works to generate evidence, influence policy and strengthen rights-respecting responses to mobility and displacement. Guided by human rights, inclusion and context-driven analysis, MPH focuses on climate justice, health, education, gender and technology, with the aim of amplifying affected voices, supporting community resilience and promoting durable, people-centred solutions across the continent. Access some of the publications by Migration Pulse Hub at www.migrationpulsehub.org)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
