/T (OLAM Africa Reports is a publication series that delivers timely, evidence-based analysis on the governance transitions shaping Africa's future. Drawing on rigorous research and grounded in African realities, the series provides policy-relevant insight on mobility, climate and digital governance. Each report is designed to support governments, regional organisations and development partners with practical analysis and actionable recommendations for navigating an Africa in transition.)
/E (OLAM Africa Reports is a publication series that delivers timely, evidence-based analysis on the governance transitions shaping Africa's future. Drawing on rigorous research and grounded in African realities, the series provides policy-relevant insight on mobility, climate and digital governance. Each report is designed to support governments, regional organisations and development partners with practical analysis and actionable recommendations for navigating an Africa in transition.)
