/Title (Dr Margaret Monyani is the Executive Director of OLAM Africa Research Institute, a think tank advancing research and policy on migration, climate, and digital governance across Africa.  Her work sits at the intersection of research, policy, and advocacy, with a focus on gender, mobility, and human security.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 665 0 R
/Next 1198 0 R
>>
endobj
1198 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ms. Damaris Lena Oluga is an International Relations expert with experience in diplomacy, human rights and cross-cultural project coordination.Currently she serves as a Regional Coordination Manager at Migration Pulse Hub, leveraging her expertise to bridge the gap between high-level policy advocacy and front line communities)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 665 0 R
/Prev 1197 0 R
>>
