1450 0 obj
<<
/Title (Migration Pulse Hub Migration Pulse Hub \(MPH\) is an independent, Africa-rooted organisation dedicated to advancing the rights, dignity and protection of refugees, migrants and internally displaced persons. Through research-based policy engagement, strategic legal support, advocacy and inclusive programming, MPH works to generate evidence, influence policy and strengthen rights-respecting responses to mobility and displacement. Guided by human rights, inclusion and context-driven analysis, MPH focuses on climate justice, health, education, gender and technology, with the aim of amplifying affected voices, supporting community resilience and promoting durable, people-centred solutions across the continent. Access some of the publications by Migration Pulse Hub at www.migrationpulsehub.org)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1609 0 R
/Next 1196 0 R
>>
endobj
